family; Fiona meets a handsome stranger when her purse is stolen; Lip is shocked to discover his brother Ian is gay and tries to hook him up with a willing neighbor.\",\"overviewTranslations\":[\"deu\",\"eng\",\"fin\",\"fra\",\"heb\",\"ita\",\"por\",\"rus\",\"spa\"],\"image\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/161511/2861921.jpg\",\"imageType\":11,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":1,\"absoluteNumber\":1,\"seasonNumber\":1,\"lastUpdated\":\"2024-06-13 06:24:11\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"2011\"},{\"id\":3279811,\"seriesId\":161511,\"name\":\"Frank the Plank\",\"aired\":\"2011-01-16\",\"runtime\":56,\"nameTranslations\":[\"deu\",\"eng\",\"fin\",\"fra\",\"heb\",\"ita\",\"por\",\"rus\",\"spa\",\"pol\"],\"overview\":\"Frank has a drunken run-in with Karen's father and takes it out on Ian. The family starts a manhunt when Frank is nowhere to be found on disability check day.\",\"overviewTranslations\":[\"deu\",\"eng\",\"fin\",\"fra\",\"heb\",\"ita\",\"por\",\"rus\",\"spa\",\"pol\"],\"image\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/161511/3279811.jpg\",\"imageType\":11,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":2,\"absoluteNumber\":2,\"seasonNumber\":1,\"lastUpdated\":\"2024-08-09 20:33:42\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"2011\"},{\"id\":3444601,\"seriesId\":161511,\"name\":\"Aunt Ginger\",\"aired\":\"2011-01-23\",\"runtime\":53,\"nameTranslations\":[\"deu\",\"eng\",\"fin\",\"fra\",\"heb\",\"ita\",\"por\",\"rus\",\"spa\",\"pol\"],\"overview\":\"Fiona turns her attentions to Tony, a cop who has had a crush on her since childhood, but Steve isn't willing to give up without a fight; Ian is targeted by the brothers of a girl he spurned; the whole family searches for elderly Aunt Ginger, who owns their house.\",\"overviewTranslations\":[\"deu\",\"eng\",\"fin\",\"fra\",\"heb\",\"ita\",\"por\",\"rus\",\"spa\",\"pol\"],\"image\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/161511/3444601.jpg\",\"imageType\":11,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":3,\"absoluteNumber\":3,\"seasonNumber\":1,\"lastUpdated\":\"2024-08-09 20:36:05\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"2011\"},{\"id\":3456131,\"seriesId\":161511,\"name\":\"Casey Casden\",\"aired\":\"2011-01-30\",\"runtime\":46,\"nameTranslations\":[\"deu\",\"eng\",\"fin\",\"fra\",\"heb\",\"ita\",\"por\",\"rus\",\"spa\",\"pol\"],\"overview\":\"A sad and lonely Debbie steals a little boy from a birthday party, forcing the family to scheme a way to return him; a web of lies ends in a marriage proposal from Kevin, who is already married.\\r\\n\",\"overviewTranslations\":[\"deu\",\"eng\",\"fin\",\"fra\",\"heb\",\"ita\",\"por\",\"rus\",\"spa\",\"pol\"],\"image\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/161511/3456131.jpg\",\"imageType\":11,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":4,\"absoluteNumber\":4,\"seasonNumber\":1,\"lastUpdated\":\"2024-08-09 20:36:47\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"2011\"},{\"id\":3456141,\"seriesId\":161511,\"name\":\"Three Boys\",\"aired\":\"2011-02-06\",\"runtime\":45,\"nameTranslations\":[\"deu\",\"eng\",\"fin\",\"fra\",\"heb\",\"ita\",\"por\",\"rus\",\"spa\",\"pol\"],\"overview\":\"When the Gallagher's find out Veronica comes from a wealthy family, they try to scheme a fake wedding for the dowry. Meanwhile, Frank gets some bad news about his health.\",\"overviewTranslations\":[\"deu\",\"eng\",\"fin\",\"fra\",\"heb\",\"ita\",\"por\",\"rus\",\"spa\",\"pol\"],\"image\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/161511/3456141.jpg\",\"imageType\":11,\"isMovie\":0,\"seasons\":null,\"number\":5,\"absoluteNumber\":5,\"seasonNumber\":1,\"lastUpdated\":\"2024-08-09 20:39:37\",\"finaleType\":null,\"year\":\"2011\"},{\"id\":3456151,\"seriesId\":161511,\"name\":\"Killer Carl\",\"aired\":\"2011-02-13\",\"runtime\":51,\"nameTranslations\":[\"deu\",\"eng\",\"fin\",\"fra\",\"heb\",\"ita\",\"por\",\"rus\",\"spa\",\"pol\"],\"overview\":\"Fiona tries to prove the Gallagher home is suitable for rehabilitating a delinquent after receiving a lette